%% Lab 13: search as a tool. The model writes each query or the answer (ink); our code runs the search, adds the
%% reply and the search result to the messages list and checks the turn cap (lime). A query written after reading a
%% result can use words that only that result held.
%% Two exits: the model's answer, or our turn cap.
%% Export: npx -y @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli -i lab13_agentic_rag.mmd -o lab13_agentic_rag.png -b white -s 2
flowchart LR
    question[the question] --> list[messages list: the question,<br/>the model's replies and<br/>every search result so far]
    list --> model[the model replies<br/>with a search query<br/>or with the answer]
    model -->|tool call:<br/>search query| run[our code embeds<br/>the query and returns<br/>the two nearest documents]
    run --> result[our code adds the reply<br/>and the two documents'<br/>text to the list]
    result --> left{turns<br/>left?}
    left -->|yes: go round again<br/>with these results in the list| list
    left -->|no| cap[the turn cap<br/>no answer: None]
    model -->|text| answer[the answer]
    classDef model fill:#0B1220,color:#FFFFFF,stroke:#0B1220
    classDef code fill:#C9F24D,color:#0B1220,stroke:#0B1220
    class model model
    class run,result,left code
